"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4i.1/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":8023},"state":{"digest":"f0dbb4b2142edc043d6aa0557eed93ea67e3a26c12ad111ebc3236f4b35746ed","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4i.1/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-10-05T19:37:01.840355+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4i.1","local_name":"bob-cli-4i.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-4i","agent_clan_generation":"20261005151355","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-4i.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-4i[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Complete any open task from capture with a whole-item [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]`!note:block-id`[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A capture item that is exactly `!note:block-id` marks that existing[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]open task Done, exactly as `=x!N` would, but without closing a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Pomodoro. In one atomic write it also closes the task's embedded [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]subtasks, retires its Task Links in today's ledger the way `bob [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]task reconcile` would, and unblocks dependents the way Obsidian's [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Ctrl+Enter does. Bulk works one item per blank-line-separated [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]block. In Bob Mac Capture, typing `!` at the start of an item opens[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]a \"Complete\" task picker over every open task in the vault. Tasks [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]with Task Links in today's daily note come first, grouped by the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Pomodoro they live in. A completion preview shows the struck task, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]its ledger effect, and the tasks it unblocks before Return writes [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]anything.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bang_task_complete.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/bang_task_complete.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-4i[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-4i/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Extract a shared task-completion engine (no new syntax)[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]engine: in bob-cli, add `src/native/task_complete/`. Extract the =x [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]embedded tree close into a reusable `complete_task_tree`, keeping =x [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]byte-identical. Expose a scoped completed-reference retirement built on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reconcile's structural planner, with an opt-in dedupe that avoids the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli-2l duplicate. Add an immediate Blocked-dependent recovery [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]matching Ctrl+Enter, built on reconcile's dependency-state definition. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Unit tests only; no user-visible change.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Lex, claim, and parse whole-item `!note:block-id`[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: in bob-cli, generalize the `&` note-locator lexer and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`replacement_for` over a sigil. Claim whole-item `!` tokens in execution[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and editor parsing. Add `CaptureKind::TaskComplete`, capture-parse [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mode/need `task_complete`, `task_complete_*` spans, the per-item [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`task_complete` object, the `invalid_task_complete` diagnostic, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]teaching refusals for queries and padded items. Execution of a complete [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]token returns a temporary refusal until `execute` lands. Grammar docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Serve the `task_complete` picker from capture-complete[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]picker_contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker_contract: in bob-cli, add the vault-wide completable-task catalog[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with today's Task Link annotations (running/worked/queued/noted), the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]today-first ordering and ranking, the `task_complete` capture-complete [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]context with `picker` descriptor and continuation keys, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`already_selected` and recurring guards, `complete_replacement` on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-task-id, shell completion for `!`, tests, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Execute `!note:block-id` through the engine with rich JSON and[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]human output[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]execute[dim] · [dim][/dim]after engine, grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]execute: in bob-cli, plan `TaskComplete` items through the staged batch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]writer. Resolve the note vault-wide, validate status and recurrence, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]then run the engine (tree close, scoped ledger retirement, dependent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recovery). Emit kind `task_complete` with the `task_complete` object and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]placement `completed`, report task_blocks roles `completed`/`unblocked`,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and print green human output. Update `bob capture --help`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/capture.md, README, and CLI tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Highlight `!` tokens and preview completions in Bob Mac [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac_preview[dim] · [dim][/dim]after execute[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac_preview: in bob-mac-capture, map the `task_complete_*` spans to the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared complete-green and the route/block-ID colors, decode the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`task_complete` result, add a pure CaptureTaskCompletePresentation and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the completion preview card (struck task, transition, subtasks, ledger, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unblocked), and update footer, notification, and VoiceOver copy. Add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]real-bob fixtures, tests, and README. Commit, then get macOS CI green.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Open the Complete picker on `!` with Today first[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac_picker[dim] · [dim][/dim]after picker_contract, mac_preview[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac_picker: in bob-mac-capture, add the `.taskComplete` picker source [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and need. Add a TaskCompletePickerIndex with per-Pomodoro Today [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sections, then In Progress, Next, and per-note sections, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Today-then-All sections while filtering. Rows show disabled reasons and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a 🍅 session count. Return inserts, Shift-Return inserts and starts the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]next `!`, Command-Return completes; Bob's continuation keys apply. The [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Add block ID flow splices `complete_replacement`. Tests, design render, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]README, green macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-4i","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-4i.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a8259922c6dcfedccf9f7d6668f7f9e9","started_at":"2026-10-05T19:14:06.968580+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1791230763,"sha":"40e561f850e17eb431570dff23b79b8015183f8b","subject":"feat(capture): serve the task_complete picker from capture-complete"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"177b67d875426a119b98cb8ea0e5032a5be82c375de77a0a0771e92f4a67bd23","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4i.3/chat.md","size_bytes":3158},"commits":{"digest":"2c27b1c3ae2b1f44faf50091a24484e9761a5c26f3905e0570799ff4c71ba64d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4i.3/commits.json","size_bytes":245},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4i.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"0e166c8b4909bef2874ae1611c754a4806447cfe5ec4d5853f265019afcf1b52","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4i.3/meta.json","size_bytes":718},"prompt":{"digest":"2798c4b5d6cfce0cbcf6c2787496d3cb4a4b454841071c0dc50d62491b41a1db","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4i.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":159},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"5e397f1be6359012b86663f16e05543755aad1d0943e5b03e8d1a7a6a48f1ebe","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4i.3/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":6974},"state":{"digest":"183b4368a8a6d580c6f8ec8898655bca01781ce2f3ba03ad1b985cdd8434b86e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4i.3/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-10-05T20:07:18.277796+00:00","glo